		{"id":"d1e753958a1eb5b3","type":"text","text":"Show that leakage in coupler causes population in qubits to travel.","x":-363,"y":300,"width":259,"height":94},
		{"id":"8cb743adb1acdf2a","type":"text","text":"Adding an excitation causes some of the coupler population to travel to the removal transmon. So the pumped case can also remove population in the coupler. On the other hand, if the removal is too slow it can then pump population to the qubit.","x":-51,"y":300,"width":320,"height":240},
